  "details": "Or, make a dedicated \"open system keyboard\" button like the \"clear text\" button, since (at least in my opinion) clicking the textbox is unintuitive without a marker of some description.\n\nA few times I've clicked the text box to move the cursor out of habit (since it does that on PC), which instead opens the janky Pico system keyboard. Once that's open, closing it with B cancels whatever I was typing, and pressing enter submits it, with no way to go back to the normal VRChat keyboard.",
